1
00:05:23,076 --> 00:05:29,076
When the game ends, the mystery begins.

2
00:10:46,153 --> 00:10:52,153
Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery is a comedy, crime,
mystery film directed by Rian Johnson.

3
00:16:09,230 --> 00:16:15,230
World-famous detective Benoit Blanc heads to Greece to peel back the layers of a
mystery surrounding a tech billionaire and his eclectic crew of friends.

4
00:21:32,307 --> 00:21:38,307
Benoit Blanc, played by Daniel Craig.

5
00:26:55,384 --> 00:27:01,384
Miles Bron, played by Edward Norton.

6
00:32:18,461 --> 00:32:24,461
Andi Brand, played by Janelle Monáe.

7
00:37:41,538 --> 00:37:47,538
Claire Debella, played by Kathryn Hahn.

8
00:43:04,615 --> 00:43:10,615
Lionel Toussaint, played by Leslie Odom Jr..

9
00:48:27,692 --> 00:48:33,692
Birdie Jay, played by Kate Hudson.

10
00:53:50,769 --> 00:53:56,769
Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery is a 2022 American mystery film written and
directed by Rian Johnson, and produced by Johnson and Ram Bergman.

11
00:59:13,846 --> 00:59:19,846
It is a standalone sequel to the 2019 film Knives Out, and the
second installment in the Knives Out film series.

12
01:04:36,923 --> 01:04:42,923
Glass Onion sees Daniel Craig return as master detective Benoit Blanc as he takes on a new case
revolving around tech billionaire Miles Bron (played by Edward Norton) and his closest friends.

13
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The ensemble cast also includes Janelle Monáe, Kathryn Hahn, Leslie Odom Jr.,
Jessica Henwick, Madelyn Cline, Kate Hudson, and Dave Bautista.

14
01:15:23,076 --> 01:15:29,076
Johnson had considered several films featuring the Benoit
Blanc character before the first film's release.

15
01:20:46,153 --> 01:20:52,153
A sequel was greenlit by its original distributor Lionsgate in 2020, but in March 2021
Netflix bought the rights to two Knives Out sequels for $469 million.

16
01:26:09,230 --> 01:26:15,230
The cast signed on that May.

17
01:31:32,307 --> 01:31:38,307
Filming took place on the Greek island of Spetses in June and July
2021, and continued in Belgrade until September.

18
01:36:55,384 --> 01:37:01,384
Following its world premiere at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 10, 2022, Glass Onion
began a one-week limited theatrical release on November 23, 2022, and grossed $15 million.

19
01:42:18,461 --> 01:42:24,461
Netflix began streaming it on December 23.

20
01:47:41,538 --> 01:47:47,538
Like its predecessor, Glass Onion received critical acclaim, with reviewers praising Johnson's screenplay and direction,
the performances of the cast, and the musical score; although some viewed it as inferior to the first film.

21
01:53:04,615 --> 01:53:10,615
The National Board of Review named Glass Onion as
one of the top ten films of 2022.

22
01:58:27,692 --> 01:58:33,692
The film received a nomination for Best Adapted Screenplay at the 95th
Academy Awards, and received numerous other accolades.

23
02:03:50,769 --> 02:03:56,769
A third Knives Out film, Wake Up Dead Man, was
released in theaters on November 26, 2025.

24
02:09:13,846 --> 02:09:19,846
The film explores themes of detective, greece,
investigation, mona lisa (la gioconda), dark comedy.

25
02:14:36,923 --> 02:14:42,923
The tone is lighthearted and dark and mind_bending.
